<title>USA: Tropical Cyclone shipping threat in Pacific Ocean.</title>
<headline>Tropical Cyclone shipping threat in Pacific Ocean.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone 16P was expected to intensify to the northwest of Espiritu Santo Island in the Pacific Ocean, becoming an increasing risk to shipping over the next 48 hours, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>The cyclone was tracking southwestward well north of New Caledonia with winds currently around 40 mph.</p>
</text>
